        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PARPRT, Parthenon Plate with Portofino Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor an authentic building restoration, or simply to achieve a distinctive and romantic touch, Grandeur's Parthenon Plate With Portofino Lever makes a profound statement in luxury. Its ornate styling is perfect for fancier home décors. The Portofino Lever's simple lines draw attention to the beautiful detailing on the rose. This Grandeur made Parthenon Plate With Portofino Door Lever will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-parthenon-series\"><b>Parthenon Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur PARPRT Parthenon Plate With Portofino Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Parthenon Plate With Portofino Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Height: 7.84\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Length: 4.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Projection: 2.22\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PAR-plate.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Parthenon Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PRT-lever.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Portofino Lever Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Portofino Lever with Parthenon Plate",
                "description": "Parthenon Plate With Portofino Lever Grandeur PARPRT - For an authentic building restoration, or simply to achieve a distinctive and romantic touch, Grandeur's Parthenon Plate With Portofino Lever makes a profound statement in luxury. Its ornate styling is perfect for fancier home décors. The Portofino Lever's simple lines draw attention to the beautiful detailing on the rose. This Grandeur made Parthenon Plate With Portofino Door Lever will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Grandeur PARPRT, Grandeur Parthenon Plate With Portofino Levers, Grandeur Parthenon design, Grandeur Parthenon series, Portofino door Levers, Grandeur Designer Door Levers, GRA-PARPRT, wave levers, ornate levers,"
